  "rai:dataCollection": "CODEX [Cytokit + SPRM] on lymph node. Donor: 18.0 years-old Black or African American male (BMI 27.1; blood group Blood Type O; cause of death Head trauma). Specimen chain: section <- block <- organ. Instrument: Keyence BZ-X800 / prep: Akoya Biosciences CODEX Instrument. Assay parameters: number_of_antibodies=18, number_of_biomarker_imaging_rounds=9, number_of_channels=4, is_targeted=Yes, analyte_class=Protein. Full machine-readable provenance (W3C PROV) at https://entity.api.hubmapconsortium.org/entities/HBM653.RRCF.859/provenance.",
